WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:22.438
Tom was at the Royal Fair.

2
00:00:22.439 --> 00:00:25.264
"Look," said Cook.

3
00:00:25.265 --> 00:00:29.054
"It's a grab bag game!"

4
00:00:29.055 --> 00:00:33.592
"Grab bags are fun," the royal weaver said.

5
00:00:33.593 --> 00:00:36.444
"Let's play!"

6
00:00:36.445 --> 00:00:39.945
Everyone put a gift card in the bag.

7
00:00:39.946 --> 00:00:43.660
Cook put in a card for a free feast.

8
00:00:43.661 --> 00:00:47.414
The royal barber gave a free haircut.

9
00:00:47.415 --> 00:00:58.285
Tom's card said, One Free Magic Spell.

10
00:00:58.286 --> 00:01:04.726
Everyone picked a card from the bag.

11
00:01:04.727 --> 00:01:09.476
Tom took his turn.

12
00:01:09.477 --> 00:01:11.961
He pulled out a card.

13
00:01:11.962 --> 00:01:16.522
"I won a rug from the royal weaver!"

14
00:01:16.523 --> 00:01:20.871
Next it was Dirk's turn.

15
00:01:20.872 --> 00:01:31.449
Tom held his breath.

16
00:01:31.450 --> 00:01:33.526
Dirk was mean.

17
00:01:33.527 --> 00:01:36.995
Tom did not want to do a spell for him.

18
00:01:36.996 --> 00:01:41.542
Dirk pulled out a card.

19
00:01:41.543 --> 00:01:47.570
He looked at it and frowned.

20
00:01:47.571 --> 00:01:50.863
"What did you get?" Cook asked.

21
00:01:50.864 --> 00:01:55.498
Dirk didn't say anything.

22
00:01:55.499 --> 00:01:58.369
Tom was worried.

23
00:01:58.370 --> 00:02:03.007
"What if Dirk has my card?" he thought.

24
00:02:03.008 --> 00:02:06.042
More people picked cards.

25
00:02:06.043 --> 00:02:11.381
Finally there was one card left.

26
00:02:11.382 --> 00:02:16.023
A knight reached into the bag.

27
00:02:16.024 --> 00:02:18.969
"Oh goody!" the knight said.

28
00:02:18.970 --> 00:02:22.872
"I won the magic spell!"

29
00:02:22.873 --> 00:02:25.876
"Whew!" Tom thought.

30
00:02:25.877 --> 00:02:30.625
He was glad that Dirk did not get his card.

31
00:02:30.626 --> 00:02:38.340
Later the knight walked over to Tom.

32
00:02:38.341 --> 00:02:42.845
"I'll come to the lab tomorrow," the knight said.

33
00:02:42.846 --> 00:02:44.578
The knight smiled.

34
00:02:44.579 --> 00:02:48.935
Tom shivered.

35
00:02:48.936 --> 00:02:55.282
The knight had a nasty look on his face.

